            "title": "How does VPN work?",
            "eyebrow": "CIT 220 • Unit 02",
            "subtitle": "Virtual Private Networks (VPNs) & Protocols",
            "lead": "How does VPN work? 1 A VPN works by creating a secure, encrypted",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>How does VPN work?</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">1 A VPN works by creating a secure, encrypted</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>&quot;tunnel&quot; for your internet traffic to pass through, routing it via a remote VPN server instead of your ISP. This process encrypts your data, making it unreadable to third parties like hackers, your ISP, and governments, and hides your real IP address. As a result, your online activities are more private, and it appears you are browsing from the location of the VPN server, allowing you to bypass geographical restrictions.</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "How does VPN work? 1 A VPN works by creating a secure, encrypted \"tunnel\" for your internet traffic to pass through, routing it via a remote VPN server instead of your ISP. This process encrypts your data, making it unreadable to third parties like hackers, your ISP, and governments, and hides your real IP address. As a result, your online activities are more private, and it appears you are browsing from the location of the VPN server, allowing you to bypass geographical restrictions.",
            "codeSnippets": [],
            "tables": [],
            "images": []
