            "subtitle": "Virtual Private Networks (VPNs) & Protocols",
            "lead": "Here's a breakdown of VPN examples: Commercial VPN Services These are services you can subscribe to for personal use to encrypt your",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>Here&#x27;s a breakdown of VPN examples:</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Commercial VPN Services These are services you can subscribe to for personal use to encrypt your</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>internet traffic and hide your IP address.  ExpressVPN: Known for its user-friendly interface and fast speeds.  NordVPN: Offers strong privacy features and is often considered a top choice.  Surfshark: A secure option with the ability to connect unlimited devices.  ProtonVPN: Praised for its speed and reliability.  CyberGhost: A beginner-friendly and secure VPN service.  Hide.me VPN: Another example of a personal VPN provider.</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "Here's a breakdown of VPN examples: Commercial VPN Services These are services you can subscribe to for personal use to encrypt your internet traffic and hide your IP address.  ExpressVPN: Known for its user-friendly interface and fast speeds.  NordVPN: Offers strong privacy features and is often considered a top choice.  Surfshark: A secure option with the ability to connect unlimited devices.  ProtonVPN: Praised for its speed and reliability.  CyberGhost: A beginner-friendly and secure VPN service.  Hide.me VPN: Another example of a personal VPN provider.",
