            "eyebrow": "CIT 220 • Unit 02",
            "subtitle": "Virtual Private Networks (VPNs) & Protocols",
            "lead": "Here's a breakdown of VPN examples: Enterprise & Business VPNs These are designed to connect employees to a company network",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>Here&#x27;s a breakdown of VPN examples:</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Enterprise &amp; Business VPNs These are designed to connect employees to a company network</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>or link multiple office locations.  Remote Access VPN: Allows individual users to connect to a private network. Examples include Cisco AnyConnect and Access Server by OpenVPN.  Site-to-Site VPN: Connects two or more separate networks, such as different office branches, to create a unified network.</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "Here's a breakdown of VPN examples: Enterprise & Business VPNs These are designed to connect employees to a company network or link multiple office locations.  Remote Access VPN: Allows individual users to connect to a private network. Examples include Cisco AnyConnect and Access Server by OpenVPN.  Site-to-Site VPN: Connects two or more separate networks, such as different office branches, to create a unified network.",
