            "id": "slide-30",
            "slideNumber": 30,
            "title": "A VPN connection establishes a secure connection",
            "eyebrow": "CIT 220 • Unit 02",
            "subtitle": "Virtual Private Networks (VPNs) & Protocols",
            "lead": "A VPN connection establishes a secure connection between you and the internet. Via the VPN, all your data traffic is routed through an encrypted virtual tunnel. This",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>A VPN connection establishes a secure connection</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">between you and the internet. Via the VPN, all your data traffic is routed through an encrypted virtual tunnel. This</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>disguises your IP address when you use the internet, making its location invisible to everyone. A VPN connection is also secure against external attacks. That&#x27;s because only you can access the data in the encrypted tunnel - and nobody else can because they don&#x27;t have the key. A VPN allows you to access regionally restricted content from anywhere in the world. Conclusion</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "A VPN connection establishes a secure connection between you and the internet. Via the VPN, all your data traffic is routed through an encrypted virtual tunnel. This disguises your IP address when you use the internet, making its location invisible to everyone. A VPN connection is also secure against external attacks. That's because only you can access the data in the encrypted tunnel - and nobody else can because they don't have the key. A VPN allows you to access regionally restricted content from anywhere in the world. Conclusion",
