            "lead": "LABORATORY ACTIVITY No. 1 Getting connected with VPN Application A VPN is only as secure as the VPN provider and",
            "isTitleSlide": false,
            "isSectionDivider": false,
            "rawHtml": "<h3>LABORATORY ACTIVITY No. 1</h3><p class=\"lead-statement\">Getting connected with VPN Application A VPN is only as secure as the VPN provider and</p><div class=\"info-card mt-3\"><p>the network it connects to, making it crucial to use a reputable VPN, enable multi-factor authentication (MFA), and ensure your own devices are free from malware to protect against these threats.</p></div>",
            "cleanText": "LABORATORY ACTIVITY No. 1 Getting connected with VPN Application A VPN is only as secure as the VPN provider and the network it connects to, making it crucial to use a reputable VPN, enable multi-factor authentication (MFA), and ensure your own devices are free from malware to protect against these threats.",
